WEBVTT

00:10.420 --> 00:14.040
You protected me, Shiori?

00:14.820 --> 00:16.700
Shingo-san...

00:17.960 --> 00:19.170
Matoi,

00:19.170 --> 00:21.400
I had you worried, didn't I?

00:21.400 --> 00:22.450
I'm sorry.

00:22.850 --> 00:23.670
And...

00:25.890 --> 00:27.210
thank you.

00:30.290 --> 00:32.470
Shin-kun, I'm glad you're safe.

00:33.750 --> 00:35.600
The stars are so beautiful tonight.

02:08.640 --> 02:11.240
Saphirus, to think even you failed...

02:13.380 --> 02:15.100
I will defeat our enemy.

02:15.100 --> 02:19.000
I'll use my flames to burn
those little girls to a crisp.

02:19.780 --> 02:20.740
Who is that?

02:20.740 --> 02:23.330
I think what happened to
Saphirus was most unfortunate.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.580
Set.

02:25.860 --> 02:26.820
Why?

02:26.820 --> 02:29.190
Why did you send Saphirus into battle alone?

02:29.190 --> 02:32.560
If I had been accompanying her, this wouldn't have happened!

02:32.560 --> 02:35.810
I underestimated those girls' abilities.

02:35.810 --> 02:37.970
Saphirus' death is entirely my fault.

02:38.450 --> 02:40.440
Then give me the order.

02:40.440 --> 02:44.600
Allow me to turn those little girls to ash.

02:44.600 --> 02:46.050
I cannot.

02:46.050 --> 02:46.770
Why?

02:47.090 --> 02:48.390
Look.

02:49.120 --> 02:51.350
The Cavitas is growing wider?

02:51.850 --> 02:53.870
Do you know why?

02:53.870 --> 02:54.950
It can't be.

02:54.950 --> 02:56.860
The door to the highest dimension?

02:56.860 --> 02:59.450
Indeed. It's beginning to open.

02:59.450 --> 03:03.620
And when that process is complete,

03:03.620 --> 03:07.160
our grand goal will be accomplished.

03:07.160 --> 03:10.120
We will have unified
all dimensions into one,

03:10.120 --> 03:13.560
and the Nights will rule this new dimension.

03:13.560 --> 03:16.170
I want to remove any obstacles that could stand in our way.

03:16.960 --> 03:20.870
Our objective is more important than
plotting revenge for Saphirus, is it not?

03:20.870 --> 03:22.890
What do you want me to do?

03:24.770 --> 03:26.090
Good boy.

03:35.010 --> 03:37.150
I'm sorry to have called you out like—

03:37.150 --> 03:38.440
No need for the formalities.

03:38.820 --> 03:42.200
Is it true that a Gate of Caelum is opening?

03:42.200 --> 03:44.500
We haven't been able to confirm it on our end.

03:44.940 --> 03:48.080
The IATO's observational team reported

03:48.080 --> 03:52.160
that a minuscule interdimensional hole has appeared over Japan.

03:52.160 --> 03:54.380
Clarus-san, would you mind confirming this?

03:56.930 --> 03:57.880
Understood.

04:03.990 --> 04:05.280
I can see it.

04:05.280 --> 04:07.680
And it appears to be slowly expanding.

04:07.680 --> 04:09.930
An expanding Gate of Caelum...

04:09.930 --> 04:10.910
Could it be?

04:10.910 --> 04:14.300
Indeed, it seems very similar to what happened ten years ago.

04:14.730 --> 04:18.080
And while the hole disappeared quickly last time,

04:18.080 --> 04:22.320
it could possibly grow even bigger this time,
and destroy the borders between the dimensions.

04:22.580 --> 04:26.000
The Nights will overrun this world.

04:26.480 --> 04:28.430
M-Master Seigen!

04:28.430 --> 04:32.240
The shrine maidens have reported spotting a hole in the sky!

04:32.240 --> 04:34.000
I know.

04:34.000 --> 04:36.000
So they've finally come.

04:36.370 --> 04:38.760
We're headed out!
Make the necessary preparations.

04:38.760 --> 04:39.840
Yes, sir!

04:41.470 --> 04:42.960
The Open Gate!

04:54.420 --> 04:57.310
Enjoy yourselves!

04:55.710 --> 04:57.880
Such implications behind her laughter...

04:57.880 --> 05:00.800
Did I make another mistake?

05:01.940 --> 05:05.170
Oh, and about that case
you're holding, young lady...

05:05.170 --> 05:08.400
It appears you have a means
of binding a god to you

05:08.400 --> 05:10.700
and a way to measure your alignment with it,

05:11.310 --> 05:15.730
but it'll take more than that to call you a true shrine maiden of Divine Union.

05:15.730 --> 05:17.560
You'll hit your limit someday.

05:20.230 --> 05:21.700
<i>My limit...</i>

05:22.210 --> 05:24.790
Can you still see the dimensional hole?

05:24.790 --> 05:25.660
Yes.

05:26.670 --> 05:28.220
You're—

05:28.570 --> 05:30.280
How did you find this place?

05:30.280 --> 05:33.150
Of course, I have my means of seeking you out.

05:35.490 --> 05:36.520
A homing device!

05:36.980 --> 05:39.190
Can you come with me for a bit?

05:39.190 --> 05:43.480
I think Vatican-san ought to hear this too.

05:44.690 --> 05:47.820
Toi-san, how's your papa doing?

05:48.180 --> 05:51.920
The doctor says it's just a minor case of frostbite.

05:51.920 --> 05:55.940
He wants to keep him in the hospital for two or three more days for observation.

05:55.940 --> 05:58.440
But he's just dying to be discharged.

05:58.440 --> 06:00.370
That's good to hear.

06:00.370 --> 06:05.800
When I heard a demon possessed him,
I worried about what was going to happen to him.

06:06.550 --> 06:08.900
Mom saved him.

06:08.900 --> 06:10.500
You mean...

06:10.500 --> 06:13.040
Aunt Shiori was there?

06:13.040 --> 06:14.640
No, nothing like that.

06:14.990 --> 06:19.100
But just as Shingo-san was saved,
I felt something warm all around me.

06:19.100 --> 06:21.650
It felt just like Mom.

06:22.220 --> 06:23.020
Yeah,

06:23.600 --> 06:25.640
I think it had to have been Mom.

06:27.000 --> 06:29.220
Something warm...

06:29.220 --> 06:32.510
It if really was her, does that mean...

06:33.200 --> 06:38.210
Mom was probably a shrine maiden of
Divine Union, wasn't she? Just like us.

06:38.210 --> 06:40.500
Allow me to interrupt.

06:40.500 --> 06:42.050
Grandpa!

06:42.050 --> 06:45.210
It's been a while, Yuma, Matoi.

06:45.210 --> 06:48.920
May I have a bit of your time?

06:50.480 --> 06:52.620
What's up all of the sudden?

06:52.620 --> 06:53.640
Um,

06:54.050 --> 06:59.260
I have to take some clothes to Shingo-san at the hospital.

06:59.260 --> 07:02.050
I'll make arrangements to have that delivered to him.

07:02.050 --> 07:03.350
But...

07:03.350 --> 07:08.190
I need to talk to you two about Matoi's mother, Shiori.

07:09.000 --> 07:10.560
My mother?

07:10.560 --> 07:14.160
And about you as well, Matoi.

07:14.720 --> 07:18.350
Man, you've got the worst luck lately, Shin-kun!

07:18.350 --> 07:20.660
Getting attacked by a demon <i>twice</i>?

07:20.660 --> 07:23.870
Why was the demon at Kamagaya Tower?

07:23.870 --> 07:25.920
Was it after the exorcist girl?

07:25.920 --> 07:27.400
It's the other way around, right?

07:27.750 --> 07:30.760
She was chasing after the demon, obviously.

07:30.760 --> 07:34.150
You and Matoi just happened to be there too!

07:34.150 --> 07:37.030
Demons showed up twice at Tenkai Beach as well.

07:37.030 --> 07:38.180
Is that <i>also</i> a coincidence?

07:40.340 --> 07:41.520
You don't think so?

07:41.980 --> 07:43.480
Plan to share that or what?

07:44.760 --> 07:46.120
Hand it over!

07:46.120 --> 07:47.570
I'm sorry, I wasn't thinking.

07:48.390 --> 07:50.780
Well, I <i>have</i> been thinking.

07:50.780 --> 07:55.690
The demons must be targeting one of us.

07:55.690 --> 07:57.800
You're overthinking it!

07:58.160 --> 08:00.770
Get some rest, Shin-kun.

08:00.770 --> 08:05.220
Don't worry, I'll take care of every case that comes up while you're stuck here!

08:05.220 --> 08:07.710
That's what worries me the most.

08:09.120 --> 08:11.340
There's nobody visiting the shrine today.

08:11.810 --> 08:13.940
I cleared everyone out.

08:13.940 --> 08:15.040
Why?

08:15.040 --> 08:16.800
Everyone should be inside.

08:16.800 --> 08:17.850
We'll talk there.

08:20.840 --> 08:22.280
Clarie-san?

08:22.280 --> 08:23.590
Azu?

08:24.660 --> 08:26.400
Luciela-sensei?

08:26.400 --> 08:28.000
Even Yayoi-san?

08:28.440 --> 08:30.610
It would seem everyone is here.

08:31.040 --> 08:33.110
Why have you called us here?

08:33.510 --> 08:35.910
My name is Kusanagi Seigen.

08:35.910 --> 08:39.640
Or more clearly put,
I am a descendant of the Kusanagi Clan.

08:39.640 --> 08:44.480
My family has been performing exorcisms in this country for more than 2,000 years.

08:44.480 --> 08:47.500
In other words, he's our general manager.

08:48.080 --> 08:52.260
I believe the Vatican and
the IATO already know this,

08:52.600 --> 08:56.980
but there is a dimensional hole
in the sky, and it's only getting bigger.

08:56.980 --> 08:58.460
A dimensional hole?

08:58.460 --> 09:00.770
Up in the sky. Take a look for yourselves.

09:03.570 --> 09:05.650
I can see it!

09:05.650 --> 09:07.400
That's a dimensional hole?

09:07.660 --> 09:10.860
The same phenomenon occurred ten years ago.

09:10.860 --> 09:11.960
Correct.

09:11.960 --> 09:15.650
It's the peak of the 24 dimensions.

09:15.650 --> 09:18.470
We call it "the highest dimension."

09:18.470 --> 09:22.420
And now the door to that
"highest dimension" is trying to open.

09:22.420 --> 09:24.000
The peak of the dimensions?

09:24.400 --> 09:26.360
The door to the highest dimension...

09:26.360 --> 09:29.700
You're claiming such a thing exists?

09:29.700 --> 09:33.880
There are references to it in my family's scripture.

09:33.880 --> 09:36.110
I'm sure it sounds like nonsense to you,

09:36.110 --> 09:39.180
but would you mind listening for a little while longer?

09:39.970 --> 09:41.400
All right.

09:41.400 --> 09:44.470
Assuming this "highest dimension" exists,

09:44.470 --> 09:47.270
what happens when the door to it opens?

09:47.730 --> 09:50.100
The borders between dimensions disappear,

09:50.100 --> 09:53.730
and it is said that all natural law will collapse.

09:54.020 --> 09:56.990
The world will be thrown into chaos, simply put.

09:57.440 --> 09:59.430
When the hole opened ten years ago,

09:59.430 --> 10:02.740
we dispatched a shrine maiden to the highest dimension.

10:02.740 --> 10:07.370
Someone who was unified with a god capable of going that far.

10:07.370 --> 10:09.920
We sent her to shut the door, of course.

10:10.400 --> 10:13.450
That maiden was Kusanagi Shiori,

10:13.450 --> 10:16.080
no, Sumeragi Shiori.

10:16.080 --> 10:18.100
Your mother, Matoi.

10:19.060 --> 10:21.000
Matoi's mother...

10:21.590 --> 10:22.930
...was unified.

10:23.190 --> 10:27.500
I think... I already knew that, on some level.

10:28.250 --> 10:29.720
Please tell me!

10:29.720 --> 10:33.550
So if my mom went there, where is she now?

10:35.090 --> 10:38.680
Even we don't know what happened to her after she set out on her journey.

10:38.680 --> 10:39.920
No way...

10:39.920 --> 10:44.370
But the dimensional hole that
appeared ten years ago disappeared.

10:44.370 --> 10:49.200
I have no doubt Shiori was the one who
stopped the highest dimension from opening.

10:49.200 --> 10:52.550
Then why doesn't she come home?

10:52.550 --> 10:53.990
We don't know.

10:53.990 --> 10:56.000
We have no way of contacting her.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.660
Mom...

11:00.610 --> 11:01.800
Toi-san...

11:02.830 --> 11:08.580
Without Shiori, we wouldn't have been able to avert calamity ten years ago.

11:08.580 --> 11:11.900
However, another hole has now opened.

11:11.900 --> 11:16.520
Someone must enter the highest dimension if we are to avoid disaster once again.

11:16.520 --> 11:21.600
We need a shrine maiden who can travel to the far end of the 24 dimensions.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.510
Don't tell me

11:22.510 --> 11:24.480
That shrine maiden would be...

11:24.480 --> 11:26.910
The one who holds the power of the Myriad god.

11:30.590 --> 11:32.150
I'll go!

11:32.150 --> 11:34.680
I'm a shrine maiden of Divine Union too!

11:34.680 --> 11:37.460
Your gods can't cross into the highest dimension.

11:37.460 --> 11:41.840
Matoi is the only one
who has a god strong enough.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.510
It would be even more impossible for you.

11:44.020 --> 11:45.220
You understand that, don't you?

11:48.510 --> 11:51.620
Um, I think I understand the situation pretty well now.

11:51.620 --> 11:55.610
I understand why you didn't tell me
or Shingo-san about my mother.

11:55.980 --> 11:58.660
But this is all too sudden.

11:58.660 --> 11:59.860
I'm sorry.

11:59.860 --> 12:02.300
I'd like to have a while to think.

12:02.970 --> 12:03.820
Toi-san...

12:04.420 --> 12:06.930
Sorry, I'd like to be alone for a while.

12:13.790 --> 12:16.880
Please tell me one last thing.

12:16.880 --> 12:20.800
Why did my mother decide to go to the highest dimension?

12:21.230 --> 12:23.400
Matoi-san, Shiori—

12:23.400 --> 12:26.550
As the head of this family, I ordered her to.

12:29.770 --> 12:32.120
I... see...

12:37.940 --> 12:39.470
You made her cry!

12:39.470 --> 12:41.440
You made Toi-san cry!

12:41.900 --> 12:45.910
She's finally starting to live
with her father again!

12:45.910 --> 12:49.600
Why are you telling her all this now!?
You bitter old man!

12:49.600 --> 12:51.580
Stop it, Yuma.

12:51.580 --> 12:53.920
You're horrible! You're all horrible!

12:53.920 --> 12:56.600
You're throwing all the danger onto Toi-san!

12:56.600 --> 12:59.000
Just like you did to Aunt Shiori!

12:59.000 --> 13:02.680
If you want to go so badly, go yourselves!

13:02.680 --> 13:05.210
We can't. That's why we're telling you this.

13:05.210 --> 13:08.480
So that makes it okay to throw all this onto Toi-san and make her cry!?

13:08.480 --> 13:10.560
You're so selfish! It's not fair!

13:10.560 --> 13:11.850
It's not fair, you cowards!

13:16.390 --> 13:18.530
It's hard being the boss.

13:18.530 --> 13:22.970
This is nothing compared to the pain that girl must be feeling.

13:27.020 --> 13:29.780
Toi-san! Toi-san!

13:29.780 --> 13:32.510
Toi-san, where are you?

13:32.510 --> 13:33.580
Yuma.

13:34.180 --> 13:35.420
Papa.

13:35.420 --> 13:38.550
Leave Matoi alone for now.

13:39.370 --> 13:43.930
Papa, did you know about
Aunt Shiori and Matoi?

13:44.170 --> 13:46.460
Of course I did.

13:46.460 --> 13:49.680
That's why I decided not to succeed
your grandfather as head of the family.

13:50.100 --> 13:53.700
I can't do that kind of painful work.

13:54.640 --> 13:57.070
How do I say this?

13:57.070 --> 14:01.360
The situation's so crazy that
I'm almost laughing...

14:02.060 --> 14:03.380
Mom,

14:03.380 --> 14:07.200
I think I know how you must have felt.

14:07.500 --> 14:10.100
I'm an exorcist girl now, too.

14:10.590 --> 14:14.650
You went to the highest dimension for me and Shingo-san, didn't you?

14:14.650 --> 14:17.170
To protect the people
who were important to you.

14:17.810 --> 14:20.800
So I have to ask my god to take me there too.

14:21.150 --> 14:26.090
Shingo-san, Yuma-chan, Clarus-san, and Luciela-sensei...

14:26.090 --> 14:28.850
I need to go to the highest dimension for everyone's sake.

14:28.850 --> 14:30.260
I wish...

14:33.430 --> 14:36.020
But if... if...

14:36.020 --> 14:41.430
If I leave, Shingo-san will be all alone.

14:41.430 --> 14:43.360
I don't want that!

14:44.110 --> 14:45.550
I don't want it.

14:46.860 --> 14:49.630
You're pathetic, Sumeragi Shingo.

14:49.630 --> 14:53.010
If you'd just thought, you would have realized it right away.

14:53.010 --> 14:56.400
But somewhere deep in your heart,
you'd already decided that it wasn't true.

14:57.120 --> 14:58.700
I had absolutely convinced myself.

14:59.540 --> 15:00.570
Excuse me...

15:00.570 --> 15:04.230
Do you really plan on sending
Matoi to the highest dimension?

15:04.230 --> 15:07.030
Shrine maidens of Divine Union welcome gods

15:07.030 --> 15:10.440
into their bodies with prayer and use that power to work miracles.

15:10.440 --> 15:13.180
If she doesn't wish it, her god won't answer.

15:13.180 --> 15:16.190
So long as Matoi doesn't wish for this from the bottom of her heart...

15:18.730 --> 15:19.560
It's me.

15:20.190 --> 15:21.800
Nights at Fatima headquarters!?

15:23.660 --> 15:26.520
All of the Anti-Creed's Regalia
have been destroyed!?

15:26.990 --> 15:28.200
Is that true?

15:28.200 --> 15:31.070
Flors-san! Is Flors Oriens safe?

15:31.070 --> 15:33.490
The Anti-Creed were their only target.

15:33.490 --> 15:37.980
You are the only one who can battle Nights now, Clarus.

15:37.980 --> 15:39.420
But that's—

15:43.550 --> 15:44.460
What's going on?

15:44.460 --> 15:45.560
It can't be.

15:46.540 --> 15:47.760
That's—

15:48.020 --> 15:48.880
Nights?

15:49.510 --> 15:52.140
Where are you, enemy of Saphirus?

15:59.490 --> 16:01.690
What are you doing, you walking curse!

16:01.690 --> 16:02.480
Papa?

16:02.480 --> 16:03.580
It's all right.

16:03.580 --> 16:06.690
I've practiced my faith, and
I know how to perform an exorcism!

16:12.460 --> 16:14.250
I'll knock you out of your vessel!

16:14.250 --> 16:14.910
Indeed.

16:17.930 --> 16:18.870
A barrier?

16:19.230 --> 16:20.210
Clarus!

16:20.210 --> 16:20.960
Roger!

16:21.450 --> 16:25.800
Do you really think that this is enough to contain me?

16:27.310 --> 16:28.220
Papa!

16:30.090 --> 16:31.450
This is the end.

16:36.810 --> 16:39.100
How dare you attack my shrine!

16:39.620 --> 16:41.270
I don't see the girl I'm really after.

16:41.270 --> 16:43.300
Why did you attack Fatima?

16:43.300 --> 16:45.700
I only followed orders.

16:45.700 --> 16:49.140
Is the dimensional hole your doing too!?

16:49.140 --> 16:52.150
We didn't make the Cavitas.

16:52.150 --> 16:54.160
It is but the will of the highest dimension.

16:54.460 --> 16:58.120
You are the ones who are refusing to accept the creation of a new world.

16:58.430 --> 17:02.740
You're but lower dimensional <i>creatures</i> clinging to your twisted world.

17:02.740 --> 17:04.250
It's natural for you to disappear.

17:07.040 --> 17:08.260
Our weapons!

17:08.260 --> 17:10.120
He's using light and fire to melt them!

17:10.120 --> 17:12.050
I can't see the Night's body!

17:12.050 --> 17:13.900
Is he going to attack from a higher dimension?

17:14.200 --> 17:16.170
Oh, but I won't let you die easily.

17:16.170 --> 17:18.430
I'll let you all roast nice and slowly.

17:23.610 --> 17:24.700
Stop!

17:25.180 --> 17:26.480
Please stop!

17:26.860 --> 17:29.550
You've appeared, Saphirus' enemy.

17:29.550 --> 17:31.480
An enemy? Me?

17:31.480 --> 17:32.820
Saphirus.

17:33.090 --> 17:35.250
The Night you defeated yesterday.

17:35.250 --> 17:38.200
We can feel animosity
towards our enemies, too.

17:38.690 --> 17:40.760
If you want to unify, go right ahead.

17:40.760 --> 17:42.710
I'll still burn you alive.

17:43.720 --> 17:44.960
Divine—

17:44.010 --> 17:44.960
No!

17:45.660 --> 17:48.750
Toi-san, you don't need to.

17:48.750 --> 17:50.710
And you don't need to go to
the highest dimension either.

17:51.060 --> 17:53.430
You don't need to do things that hurt you!

17:53.430 --> 17:54.840
Yuma-chan...

17:56.800 --> 17:59.070
You're going to the highest dimension, you say?

17:59.070 --> 18:00.310
That will never happen!

18:02.140 --> 18:03.050
Clarus!

18:03.050 --> 18:05.430
The Night's true body is in a higher dimension!

18:06.000 --> 18:08.600
Clarie-san, I'll handle this!

18:08.600 --> 18:09.380
Yeah!

18:09.380 --> 18:10.840
Clarus-san!

18:10.840 --> 18:12.990
You don't have to fight.

18:12.990 --> 18:14.690
If that's what you want, it's fine.

18:17.680 --> 18:20.120
You can't beat me. Not with your power.

18:20.810 --> 18:23.660
You can't reach the dimension I'm in!

18:24.000 --> 18:25.580
Which dimension is his real body in?

18:25.830 --> 18:29.380
Sumeragi Matoi, you're a dangerous one.

18:29.680 --> 18:31.590
But even you won't survive a dose of my flames!

18:33.670 --> 18:35.170
Th-This is—

18:35.170 --> 18:35.670
No!

18:35.670 --> 18:36.390
Run!

18:37.470 --> 18:38.330
Yuma!

18:38.330 --> 18:39.180
Papa!

18:45.380 --> 18:47.590
My... god?

18:50.020 --> 18:51.340
I see.

18:51.340 --> 18:54.030
I already...

18:58.320 --> 18:59.450
Wh-What is this?

19:06.060 --> 19:08.000
That sword and shield!

19:08.000 --> 19:10.410
She's fully awakening.

19:10.410 --> 19:11.650
Matoi-san...

19:11.650 --> 19:14.800
So this is the power that defeated Saphirus!?

19:17.900 --> 19:18.640
What?!

19:18.940 --> 19:21.390
Toi-san, why?

19:21.680 --> 19:23.830
I heard everything, Yuma-chan.

19:23.830 --> 19:24.350
Huh?

19:24.750 --> 19:27.700
Thanks for being angry on my behalf.

19:31.820 --> 19:35.450
I won't let you escape to a higher dimension!

19:39.640 --> 19:43.700
My Regalia will only take me as far as the 12th dimension.

19:43.700 --> 19:47.080
Clarus-san, leave the rest to me!

19:48.380 --> 19:51.320
Is that what it's like to be truly unified?

19:52.170 --> 19:54.650
I can sense him. He's here!

19:54.650 --> 19:55.960
I can't believe it!

19:57.400 --> 19:59.910
You can go as far up as the 15th dimension?!

20:04.060 --> 20:06.270
I'll burn you down!

20:11.790 --> 20:12.570
Wha—

20:13.080 --> 20:15.000
I just want to be ordinary.

20:15.490 --> 20:16.990
To make that happen...

20:17.880 --> 20:19.460
You bastard!

20:19.460 --> 20:21.000
I'll have to become special!

20:22.030 --> 20:24.410
O wish, be granted!

20:27.560 --> 20:30.210
Saphirus!

20:31.370 --> 20:32.590
The battle...

20:37.730 --> 20:39.000
Hang on!

20:39.420 --> 20:42.750
Clarus-san... I...

20:42.750 --> 20:43.890
Idiot...

20:43.890 --> 20:45.880
Weren't you going to live an ordinary life?

20:45.880 --> 20:47.340
I was...

20:47.340 --> 20:49.100
That's what I'd like to do...

20:50.780 --> 20:52.460
but I made a wish.

20:55.630 --> 20:57.940
What an attack...

20:58.340 --> 21:00.730
I can't hold this body together...

21:00.730 --> 21:03.210
It would seem you have failed to enact your revenge.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.860
S-Set...

21:04.860 --> 21:08.090
Why would you leave a girl with that much power alone?

21:08.090 --> 21:11.400
Oi, Ludos, what are you talking about?

21:11.820 --> 21:14.170
This guy isn't Set.

21:14.170 --> 21:17.170
What... did you just say, Phegor?

21:17.450 --> 21:21.630
I saw it when I was wandering in the space between dimensions.

21:21.630 --> 21:23.300
Set's corpse.

21:23.680 --> 21:25.810
Then this guy is a fake?

21:25.810 --> 21:28.640
Then why did Saphirus...

21:28.640 --> 21:30.870
Why did I...

21:32.620 --> 21:34.740
Poor Ludos.

21:34.740 --> 21:37.390
It's fine. I'll defeat your enemy.

21:37.390 --> 21:39.250
But before that, answer me!

21:39.250 --> 21:40.580
Who are you?

21:40.580 --> 21:43.500
Why are you pretending to be Set?

21:43.500 --> 21:45.830
All that is left is to watch the events unfold.

21:46.790 --> 21:51.350
Now that Sumeragi Matoi has awakened,
there is no longer a need to maintain this form.

21:51.350 --> 21:54.060
Huh? What are you on about?

21:54.060 --> 21:56.530
Bye! I will be taking my leave now.

21:56.530 --> 21:58.200
Don't run away, ya bastard!

21:58.200 --> 22:01.320
Who are you!?

22:06.610 --> 22:07.920
Yo, Poochi!

22:09.020 --> 22:11.360
Shin-kun? What are you doing here?

22:11.360 --> 22:13.960
Aren't you supposed to be in the hospital?

22:15.750 --> 22:17.660
Wh-What are you—

22:17.660 --> 22:20.280
Poochi, why are you after my daughter?

22:22.820 --> 22:25.350
What... What are you?

22:26.780 --> 22:28.940
Feeling your heart

22:28.940 --> 22:37.700
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

22:28.940 --> 22:37.700
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:37.700 --> 22:43.710
matoi tsuzukeru

22:37.700 --> 22:43.710
by light and shadow

22:43.710 --> 22:47.210
The lonely one

22:49.380 --> 22:51.420
Feeling your heart

22:51.420 --> 23:00.140
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:51.470 --> 23:00.180
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

23:00.140 --> 23:06.400
sore ga shiawase nano

23:00.140 --> 23:06.400
But is that truly happiness?

23:06.400 --> 23:11.360
darekaga egao nara

23:06.400 --> 23:11.360
If someone is smiling,

23:11.360 --> 23:17.870
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

23:11.360 --> 23:17.870
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

23:17.870 --> 23:24.080
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

23:17.870 --> 23:24.080
As our paths continue to cross,

23:24.080 --> 23:28.880
kimochi ga aru

23:24.080 --> 23:28.880
our love grows stronger

23:28.880 --> 23:33.880
hitotoki no aida ni

23:28.880 --> 23:33.880
In that short span of time

23:33.880 --> 23:40.390
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:33.880 --> 23:40.390
we embrace all contradictions

23:40.390 --> 23:48.520
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:40.430 --> 23:48.570
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:48.520 --> 23:53.700
aruiteku no kana

23:48.520 --> 23:53.700
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:57.490 --> 23:59.200
I have a dream.

23:59.200 --> 24:00.810
I have something I want.

24:00.810 --> 24:02.210
I have a goal.

24:02.210 --> 24:02.940
So...

24:02.940 --> 24:05.460
I'll do my best to make this wish...

24:05.460 --> 24:07.000
come true!

24:07.300 --> 24:09.100
Next time, "I'm Headed Out!"

24:09.470 --> 24:11.050
I promise I'll come back!
